# House, tropical: a stilt house of bamboo under a steep thatched roof.
# It stands on a plank deck on stilts, with flower boxes and pink shutters.
# A finial tops the roof in place of a chimney.
# The lid (roof and the two front walls) lifts off; the room stands in the interior box.
